+## What's here
 
-⚙️ Built using NextJS, RainbowKit, Hardhat, Wagmi, Viem, and Typescript.
+- `packages/hardhat/contracts/Staker.sol` — the vault. `stake(amount)` pulls USDC in, `withdraw(amount)` sends it back. Balances are tracked per address; nobody else can move them.
+- `packages/hardhat/contracts/MockUSDC.sol` — local-only stand-in for USDC (6 decimals, same name/symbol, open `mint`). Never deployed to a live network.
+- `packages/nextjs/app/stake` — the `/stake` page: wallet USDC balance, ETH gas balance, staked position, and the stake/withdraw flow.
 
