+## Deploying
 
-To know more about its features, check out our [website](https://scaffoldeth.io).
+1. Fund a deployer account (`yarn generate` or `yarn account:import`, then `yarn account`).
+2. `yarn deploy --network base` — this wires the vault to canonical USDC and writes the address and ABI into `packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts`.
+3. `yarn verify --network base`.
+4. Set the frontend env vars (see `packages/nextjs/.env.example`) — in particular `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RPC_URL`, since the default public RPC is rate limited.
+5. `yarn vercel:yolo --prod`.
 
